{
 "$comment": [
  "Recall evaluation for kb_query: meaning-only paraphrases (zh/en) next to lexical controls, over the SYNTHETIC library in fixture.json.",
  "The three 'live-*' cases are the queries a live agent sent: one meaning-only query that missed, two lexical ones that worked.",
  "A result is a hit when its group path starts with one of expect.groups, or its title contains one of expect.titles.",
  "Negative cases must produce no PRIMARY result; fallback hits are reported separately and never count as confident.",
  "class 'heldout'：在调好 retrieval-lexicon 的 CONCEPTS 之后才写、未据其调参的意义型查询——衡量泛化，而非对本用例集的拟合。",
  "floors：--check 的下限，留一格余量；改进后可上调，不许下调来掩盖回退。"
 ],
 "floors": {
  "lexical.hit1": 1.0,
  "meaning.hit1": 0.8,
  "meaning.hit5": 0.9,
  "heldout.hit5": 0.8
 },
